  "question": "Where can I find a university within 70 kilometers toward the southwest of 70 Park Avenue Hotel, New York, NY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.979628 40.74986)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.979628 40.74986)',4326)::geography, 70000)\nAND amenity = 'university'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 202.5 AND 247.5;\n",
